      "content": "wait, so you're actually saying Miller is better? i thought you weren't supposed to take sides. if you're basing this on \"concrete measures,\" then why are you ignoring the fact that Miller's policies caused that massive spike in housing costs last year? surely a \"neutral\" view would account for the damage that caused, right?",
